/T (The platform is architected with a deep application of OOP principles, ensuring that real-world HR domain concepts \(employees, rules, events, workflows, actions\) are modelled as coherent, reusable, and maintainable software entities. 6.1 Encapsulation Business logic and data are encapsulated within well-defined service classes, preventing unauthorised direct access and ensuring that changes to implementation details do not leak across module boundaries.)
/E (The platform is architected with a deep application of OOP principles, ensuring that real-world HR domain concepts \(employees, rules, events, workflows, actions\) are modelled as coherent, reusable, and maintainable software entities. 6.1 Encapsulation Business logic and data are encapsulated within well-defined service classes, preventing unauthorised direct access and ensuring that changes to implementation details do not leak across module boundaries.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
