/P 147 0 R
/T (Together, these patterns form a codebase that is not only functionally complete today but designed to scale, extend, and evolve with minimal technical debt. The system serves equally well as a portfolio showcase, a learning reference for advanced design patterns in TypeScript, and a solid foundation for a production-grade commercial HR automation product.)
