1540 0 obj
<<
/Title (The Observer Pattern via the EventBus brings clean, decoupled event distribution across all domain modules. The Singleton Pattern ensures resource-efficient access to the RuleEngine, EventBus, and database client. The Strategy Pattern in the Evaluator enables flexible, runtime-configurable condition evaluation without any switch-case proliferation. The Factory Method Pattern in the ActionFactory allows new action types to be added without modifying any orchestration code. The Command Pattern through BaseAction provides a uniform execution interface across all action implementations. The Repository Pattern abstracts all database queries from the engine's orchestration logic.)
/Dest [34 0 R /Fit]
